id payment-reconciliation
title Reconcile payments before settling
lang kron
audience central banks, payment system operators, treasury teams
safety settlement
summary Three sources report each payment. Agreement passes, conflicts are held for a person, and settlement waits until every payment is clear.
inputs inputs.txt
step reconcile kron reconcile.k out=settled evidence labels=payments
step settle treaty end-of-day.treaty gate
